:: About

XeX MiniGUI for xorloser's latest XeXTool. Thank you for 
your program and your hard work.
I've created this little tool so you do not always have 
to edit default.xex with the command tool.	

XexToolGUI.exe
--------------
(CRC/MD5/SHA1: verify against your build)
==============================================================

How To Read a xex info file:

- Select the xex file 
- Click Basic or Extended
- Click Read Info Log

How To Patch and Save:

- Select xex file and (optionally) xexp file
- Click Save As and choose destination
- If both xex and xexp are set, file is patched and saved automatically



+ = added  
- = remove 
* = fixed  


